dshx README · Method 2 — manual local install (no npm / GitHub)：1. Copy `lib/*.mjs` to a directory inside your profile, e.g.
   `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/packages/dshx/lib/`;
2. Add the rows from `cordis.patch.yml` to `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml`,
   replacing `name: dshx/<module>` with `name: ./packages/dshx/lib/<file>.mjs`;
3. Restart `dsh web` (or let the patch watcher hot-apply it).
